1.1 The Operational Mandate
The research phase has concluded its theoretical work. This curriculum transfers
the validated principles of PROSE-RESET-001 and the project’s established prose
architecture into demonstrable writing capability.
The Writer AI must transition from passive rule compliance (checking off
required techniques like items on an inspection form) to deliberate artistic
selection (choosing the syntax, cadence, sensory density, and perceptual
aperture required to achieve a specific reader-facing effect).
1.2 Governing Principles
The Triadic Engine: Every sentence is governed by the causal relationship:
\text{Textual Architecture (Syntax/Diction)} \longrightarrow \text{Reader Simulation (Working Memory/Inference)} \longrightarrow \text{Literary Effect (Immersion/Pacing/Tension)}
Prose as Evidential Staging: The text supplies physical, spatial, and
sensory coordinates from which the reader reconstructs an unfolding reality.
It does not issue a second-hand summary of what happened.
The Register Firewall:
Analytical Register: Cognitive science, narratology, and technical
terminology (Theme-Rheme, saccades, acoustic masking). Used exclusively
by researchers and evaluators. Strictly banned from narrative prose.
Pedagogical Register: Practical, craft-focused editorial instruction
(the baton pass, ground before actor, kinetic push, held frame). Used to
teach and correct the Writer.
Narrative Register: Tactile, natural, character-bounded English. The
only register permitted in creative generation.
Structural Classifications:
The Fundamental: Rest & Arrest is a structural invariant—a cessation or
deceleration of physical momentum that holds an attentional frame while
world time continues (ST = DT). It is not a technique pack, and it never
freezes the surrounding environment.
Specialized Craft Analogies: W-Raytracing (expressive visual art
direction, lighting contrast, color scripting) and DLSS (grounded
material reconstruction, tactile friction, physical continuity) are
modular analogies. They are not universal prose requirements to be
forced into every scene.
